                <mxCell id="g4-note" value="&lt;i&gt;A ScenarioStmt is one line of the .iscn action script -- Fire (rule P_leaf: only a Goal/Task&lt;br&gt;may be fired) and Assign (asserts a status the OCL/propagation would otherwise have to derive) both target&lt;br&gt;one element, optionally qualified by an actor instance; Aggregate checks a for-all/exists property&lt;br&gt;across every declared instance of an actor type once the script has run. See mtg_verify.iscn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;labelBorderColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
